"Chak sektè revize, nome ek riserve poupremie rezidan li.\n"
"        Affectasion ou tire sor le moment passage ou konfime."

#: terra/templates/terra/home.html:130
msgid ""
"Warm shallow seas and floating forests. The landing site, and the only place "
"on the manifest with a beach."
msgstr ""
"Lanmer cho ek pewan ek foret flotan. Sit atarazaz la — ek sel endro dan "
"manife ki gen enn plaz."

#: terra/templates/terra/home.html:131
msgid "WATER 29°C"
